{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Soulsync with your Atomon buddies and begin your fantasy adventure!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soulsync with your digital partners, Atomons, to unlock a wide range of abilities. Whether you're exploring levels, battling enemies, clearing obstacles, or solving puzzles, Atomons are your irreplaceable allies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897280/extras/d9533d3d776b241000b1ad60cf49bbee.poster.avif?t=1766575812\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897280/extras/d9533d3d776b241000b1ad60cf49bbee.webm?t=1766575812\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897280/extras/d9533d3d776b241000b1ad60cf49bbee.mp4?t=1766575812\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Face the crisis and shatter the dark plot!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Totopia is facing an unprecedented Bitrot crisis. End, an entity born from human negativity, now threatens this digital paradise. Join forces with Atomons and tackle thrilling levels that combine side-scrolling, 3D exploration, and intense boss battles. Begin your mission to cleanse the Bitrot!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897280/extras/d50fea743dbca252042d8fa267be2764.poster.avif?t=1766575812\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897280/extras/d50fea743dbca252042d8fa267be2764.webm?t=1766575812\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897280/extras/d50fea743dbca252042d8fa267be2764.mp4?t=1766575812\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Party anytime anywhere! Join Super Star Games and rise to fame\uff01</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take part in a tournament and climb your way to stardom! Enjoy a wide variety of party game modes, each offering a unique experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo and challenge others in platforming trials, chaotic brawls, asymmetric battles, and resource races to win the ultimate trophy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or team up with friends in co-op mode and let the power of friendship shine through!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897280/extras/e8eb2812bd1b4d13e4d00b638ad9eff9.poster.avif?t=1766575812\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897280/extras/e8eb2812bd1b4d13e4d00b638ad9eff9.webm?t=1766575812\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897280/extras/e8eb2812bd1b4d13e4d00b638ad9eff9.mp4?t=1766575812\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Countless outfits, unlimited you!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Totopia is the perfect place to express your style. Step into the fashion scene and show off your personality! Choose outfits that match your vibe and create a look that's truly your own!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't forget to give your Atomons cool costumes too. Make sure their style matches yours, inside and out!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897280/extras/4ae7fc558e7b43e97ae5b863b0fd3167.poster.avif?t=1766575812\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897280/extras/4ae7fc558e7b43e97ae5b863b0fd3167.webm?t=1766575812\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897280/extras/4ae7fc558e7b43e97ae5b863b0fd3167.mp4?t=1766575812\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build a dream home with Atomons!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become the creative director of Pulse Avenue! Design roads, place buildings, and decorate your own stylish district.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As your district grows, you'll attract Atomons from all walks of life\u2014each with their own quirky stories! Build, share, and explore the seasons together. Cherish every moment as you create warm memories with your Atomon buddies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897280/extras/bfa9dad8d39c1d0fae2b58997297a37b.poster.avif?t=1766575812\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897280/extras/bfa9dad8d39c1d0fae2b58997297a37b.webm?t=1766575812\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897280/extras/bfa9dad8d39c1d0fae2b58997297a37b.mp4?t=1766575812\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3897280?t=1766575812","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3897280?t=1766575812","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897280/95750aa84cd0a40fbd9c9cd3d241eb802b2679e9/capsule_231x87.jpg